<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed sharply lower in active trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 583.92, down 6.87.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 426 to 142.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.16.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 22,443,900, compared with 21,403,705 Tuesday.</p>
<p>	   (Prices official as of 1330 EST/1830 GMT)</p>
</text>
